                <pb facs="0407" n="401" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg401"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Palmer to Mr. Wharton</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1889</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Letter addressed Blaine, the Department of State, and marked unofficial, mailed
                    August 3, should be read in connection with the note numbered 17 of official
                    note stating I had not put in Mora instruction.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Palmer.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
